  "_comment": "CURIOS — the Fusing Crucible's fuel supply. Every name here is deliberately ABSENT from every item catalog (materials.json, gear.json, weapons.json, armor.json). That absence is the whole point: `isInferredItem` returns true only for catalog-absent names, and the Crucible has accepted inferred items ONLY since OTA-194/195 — the feature exists to give procedurally-named junk a destiny. DO NOT backfill these into materials.json. The standing 'backfill inferred-stats items into the catalog' practice is what starved the Crucible in the first place (see HANDOFF §8); `curiosStayInferred.test.ts` fails loudly if any name here ever gains a catalog row. Names are built from the vocabulary `inferGearTagPack` reads, so each one carries the material family it looks like it should. The multi-material entries at the end are diversity powerhouses — the Crucible needs 3 DIFFERENT materials, and one of those covers two or three of them alone.",
